          <p>网关统一收口：JWT 鉴权 + 20/s 令牌桶限流，服务间只走 Feign</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bPX" startX="70" startY="90" endX="890.0006097558709" endY="90">
        <border color="rgba(220, 224, 226, 1)" width="1"/>
