        <content fontSize="12" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgba(44, 95, 124, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p>　库存兜底：UPDATE mall_item SET stock = stock - 1 WHERE id = ? AND stock &gt; 0</p>
          <p>　即使锁租期失效、并发穿透，条件更新也保证不会扣成负数；受影响行数 = 0 即视为售罄回滚。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="830" height="100" topLeftX="70" topLeftY="400" type="text" id="bXQ">
